:''For the harder version, see [[Rich Cat (Veteran)]].''
The '''Monday Stage''' (月曜ステージ, ''Getsuyō Sutēji'', '''Monday Stage''') contains three levels, each with a chance to drop a [[Rich Cat]] when completed. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.3 Update|Version 2.0.3]].

